Remove "/edit", "/describe", "/edit" and "/ink" from the frontend, they are redundant (and remove all components, composables, files in general that are associated only to them).
NO Backward compatibility, NO stubs. Clean code only.

In the home, add "Describe Image" in the "Generation mode" select.
Every selection in the "generation mode" should have a different job and maybe a different form too.

 - Text to Image: Create an image from a prompt.
 - Image o Image: Same as "Text to Image" but with an image as input (it will be changed using the prompt too)
 - Upscale Image: No prompt, only image upload.
 - Describe image: No prompt, only image upload.

  Remove? Test?
 - Recolor Image: Should try to recolor the image using the prompt.
 - Sketch to Ink: Should try to sketch the image (no prompt)
 - Style Transfer: ????

For all of them I have doubts: What options should they have?


Also, there are some models that are useful with one of these options and not with others, some are specialized some are general.
We should add a "tag" system to all models to handle this. "Where these model should be used" kinda question.
Then when we change the generation mode, we should filter the models to show only the ones that are compatible with the current mode.



